.ogg","category":"growup","text":"これでもっと、美味しいご飯が作れるようになれますでしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/F067okQn9udSph4udhIIeMzZzAUzL9Dm.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"お料理上手になる為にも、体力は必須です！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/iOle8h5Ux9xIkCmfDCTGHQtiNuf6BDsr.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"なんだかお料理がしたくなりますね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/vVlcRBQGZcHiIQSUL8UTTon56qlI5hlQ.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"もっと美味しいお料理を作るために頑張ります！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/C8y14b8nmGdey01xyXDaOmFvqTAP1rJz.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"料理に酸味を出すためには、香辛料を入れるのと、塩酸を入れるのと、どちらがいいのでしょうか…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/UyAufgD3Ul7wjN0dQDJAqenIJnKTpop6.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"食材が生きているというのはそれだけ新鮮ということですから良いことですよね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/q5lOQX3DVgSYeRUws1tMnoewYhgNHmYl.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"なんか、焦げ臭いです…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/ZsLsNf3RXpVI4439zLk2QZpBWMsoXZlb.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" …あら、私ったら！パイをオーブンに入れっばなしだったことを忘れてました！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/K9br0Q3o26jNmM8apUMZHlcm6KfpOrlo.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、先生。お腹空いてないですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/QJ49gYBjWd9Bb6R7QPpmPrzflFf1oq3H.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、先生。ご飯にしますか？ それとも…お・や・つ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/uepCi1UHg4t4mXgQqkqh7wWX5FEHzsAE.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ、見てください先生！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/ljrJC5agrgfk8y53jWUBcxtSEPPylLmY.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"この真っ赤に実ったトマト、すっごく美味しそうだと思いませんか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/ttUhzq9XECJPtnMVbmLk1SLCbwcYzKTt.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えへん、これも給食部としての成果です。 丹精込めて作った甲斐がありました！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/xJXmOJLcFPm4qQCIVznyIK3XXfWhiIEX.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あ、あっちのトマトもすごく良い感じに……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/zFRA5carG0mkfWfhFhftlpKAbKOgmVXf.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっと、あ、あれ、なのですが、その……何だかちょっと距離が……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/zZMg6OvbntIbCUjp61Ne6j3RUWSsCBbt.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"この近さですと、あの、私……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/p6WmJZDVySE8HHD9urVhi3usBzBhsnZL.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"（あ、先生の香りが……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/ftoorKmsfsGICTn0gBaE77kC3MDCT1Us.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"（な、何だか急に、胸がドキドキしてきました……！？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/dUmfkR5IEJf3jBqbe61ujgn7TqcDQmSp.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"だっ、大丈夫です、はい！ご心配なく……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/aOmgQvLpR1nhBDnn8jX7cy36j6CMaPFg.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ただその何と言いますか、えっと……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/Uj9LWDhSSdqDCutlwCPM9wx1OZSNtxll.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_MemorialLobby_5_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"何だか顔が熱くなってきて、その……！うぅ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/JxzRV7iNCamYcciuqx7jqnXeMYf4eLJA.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒に過ごす時間は、お料理をしてる時と同じくらい楽しいです","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/ZMhZwIbcL7VvVc8NxRci06vAMwSvfeWC.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"最高の香辛料は…まさしく愛です♡","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/lZRcgOPQCu3QjqtNf0SRz5F0TQCnjiyi.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この幸せを味で表現する為には、どんな食材入れればいいのか悩みますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/KFjzJEIHKLEGszjsfTL16a6d8Qx72UaP.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒に食べるお料理なら、どのようなお料理でも美味しいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/kGxN4yPoP3kqyDCYi0RwZZg8KwX0rTGj.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"私の誕生日プレゼントですか？ ふふ…。その言葉だけでも十分嬉しいですよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/jrNj9fWFC8OUhJ4A6yXVscgMGM5CD9jg.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生！ 先生に差し上げようとケーキを焼いたのですが、 それがその…。逃げちゃいました…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/T41xVv0PJZtgBLY54zB8TBpR3gWxNgZj.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィーンになるとなぜか私の作ったお菓子が人気なんです。 いたずらにぴったり…？だとか。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/OlzZEDtTn43pv8qXFPVzfoaogwUQOFmA.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お正月を迎えたのでおせち料理を作ってみました。 よろしければ味見していただいてもいいでしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/VSxGafo2mUI2hPvqrxOXv1J41pXukS17.ogg"},{"description":"Juri_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えー、その、クリスマスだから七面鳥を焼いたのですけれど… 生きてて動くローストターキーはだめですよね…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89/tKZoftKCiqvlouHt8aIJIsMJwKlGhtk0.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"juri_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue...Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/6GmhFbiXFI22I2kmPz8AfTp7zjcaEs8h.ogg"},{"description":"juri_battle_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"路上小心哦，慢走~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/9WBNV6wqWhK9dRM0KNI99L89AeRbQP1t.ogg"},{"description":"juri_battle_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"补给的事情，请不用担心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/daUqvfvmDjxR8CE1JNzW8rr904fkbjz9.ogg"},{"description":"juri_battle_tsa_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"好啦，美味的饭菜送来咯！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/4XpINYmIDXZY5BJHssaVkJmm2EgBchEd.ogg"},{"description":"juri_battle_tsa_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"各位，吃饭的时间到了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/E0HGvF1zCI05ftYat86KbKDDmsV9vM1s.ogg"},{"description":"juri_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嗯~甜甜的香味~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/14MdqRDFKvA2LKH0EkiExs6mp7KUt5OP.ogg"},{"description":"juri_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"这个也可以吃吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/wR6dKCYQ1w2jhjvdBRFYY9e7ZtV4XqiV.ogg"},{"description":"juri_cafe_act_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"要不先试着炸一下吧……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/En9ntxs6DVVmfu3OcL68Qis1A2egqVxj.ogg"},{"description":"juri_cafe_act_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"哎呀，这里真是个好地方。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/vSeX6YkQ9aQLTBIGlgtZodM5WTe0ex1t.ogg"},{"description":"juri_cafe_act_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"感觉在这里可以做出美味的料理。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/A8mCjKEi65HHXeLnsiF45rKHpRatPb2X.ogg"},{"description":"juri_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我也会帮忙的~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/b9tkjFsNthajyHkMBdGjkYgx3Y1nYWJq.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"1，2，哎呀……，","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/xsW0bWFusR4D8aRiEp52cBZhSMBe4uXM.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"只要再这样翻个面……啊？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/zJqHf8BMmk0biwLIQ6ALRvfwIQWCJT8y.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这样就完成了！……啊，等一下！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/s2SrFCzoP1q4T5DcoE2v4vIkFgk0WMfB.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/0tW2WoChJM5qSqpAWhoLcJexp1pJ9wBx.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"大家，不可以吃啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/poUQLMhD6Ad0MlNnHLXR75vsEc0r48Fn.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exskill_level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这不是给你们吃的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/aUDKo5138xUGgCGL3jC0PKkLVCKJbz2a.ogg"},{"description":"juri_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，如果用这把枪来做饭，肉的质地应该会柔软很多的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/bZ7LdYrVK929kYo4gp2cVzLhHTU1fY6p.ogg"},{"description":"juri_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"那么，就来发挥一下实力看看吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/3jSUuED3HMJ95ymzdDEuoMJJ7xyI6uWB.ogg"},{"description":"juri_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"请交给我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/7zZXHvuh0CXlyONNg3dB7PGYWB7bhjE2.ogg"},{"description":"juri_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"我是歌赫娜供餐部的朱莉。肚子饿了请随时告诉我哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/FY4sKWDfPsdZNhv7Qb7WFLMSwAteUbSE.ogg"},{"description":"juri_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"这样，我是不是就可以做出更美味的饭菜了呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/8aCbt8rRFbv6Mhd82nfZG3VqPu5fEBUy.ogg"},{"description":"juri_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"为了烹饪出更可口的饭菜，体力是必不可少的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/TOiMNAJxz07XN5ZDCKsdGaYXYBWaiLMT.ogg"},{"description":"juri_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，突然很想做饭了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/lQIkoT4jybYQWKxlwILx4I6TlCf5F3vb.ogg"},{"description":"juri_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"我会尽全力做出美味的料理的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/ERGJ8WpghnRAbBTdqaO9yaGA8MGZ3PoL.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"想给饭菜里增加酸味的话，是放调味料好呢，还是放盐酸好呢……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/dUjLVg2m7y6nOanyMVQ5ZmCima2Ru03L.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"食材还在活蹦乱跳，这说明我的用料很新鲜啊，这不是好事吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/HQh2mJULOViyMWnoZPWaMluG45fhq4yg.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"好像有股烧焦的味道……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/LruMOQ3iR4HVvQatggW4R7SLp0Lymxn0.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……哎呀，我可真是的！我忘了派还放在烤箱里呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/3Zyapz3c50mYxh8OT45nCgrJ0l7yv6xR.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"唔…… 为什么我每次做饭都会失败呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/WzNH1H515hsbbps3e5Ph83mhu7WdA0UC.ogg"},{"description":"juri_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师。您饿不饿呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/G0t0HbqAEpBDRScbL0OJ7mrpGmXoyxCd.ogg"},{"description":"juri_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师。需要用餐吗？ 还是来些……小·点·心？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/CKfwjR96sAUGiUZZ5FTvqO3jOxPfHkDl.ogg"},{"description":"juri_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"和老师一起度过的时光，就和做饭的时候一样开心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/LpWNRu5T9t58alHwyBcTbGEuOE6LfoJe.ogg"},{"description":"juri_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"最棒的调味料，就是爱！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/bgEOpvpdNX6dL8gld4tFi4rITKEjhcX4.ogg"},{"description":"juri_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"如果要用味道来表达这份幸福，应该放入什么样的材料呢？好烦恼啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/tOhjbbzN6Snqgw1sBJ1yhQgtdVzKCOxs.ogg"},{"description":"juri_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"只要是和老师一起吃饭，无论是什么样的饭菜，都会很好吃！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/1L0hJeBu71dw1DBTfoznnNYH7Zpcanjl.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"我的生日礼物？ 嘻嘻……有您这句话我就已经很开心啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/O3bYpwCLBbewwgnTR3kh7DdurA63r3gd.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐，老师！ 我本来烤了一个蛋糕，准备送给老师， 可是……蛋糕逃走了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/CvzRE7923md4bcCLoA3x6MZAu2NZWZbs.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么，一到万圣节，我做的点心就很受欢迎。 他们说什么，很适合用来搞……恶作剧……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/kUqpGeNuClNBdiLcem20BuH57GBEWmCO.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"快到正月了，我试着准备了一些年节菜。 不知道您可不可以帮我尝一下味道呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/IxlM7hfBRuAGm4cmrMv4ivjDt3yqUAtG.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……那个……因为圣诞节到了，所以我烤了火鸡…… 可是火鸡烤熟了，应该是不会活蹦乱跳的吧……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/2n0ZuWaKgmirv5kOFUq7qBtR7krM5i3m.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"我在年夜饭里加入了很多很多的爱！老师，趁它还没逃走，快来尝尝吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/oFaPHV5Ta3h35NEGTu4LU8iS4D61DFwx.ogg"},{"description":"juri_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么，歌赫娜的大家好像不怎么欢迎我做的月饼……老师，您会吃的吧？一定会的吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/CBfMWw8ZOcPGoJvQCRdilP6Q02J74asR.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊， 请看看这个，老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/i16dvwB0ICzNbj4JiGBzxH4EGwBCGq04.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"这颗红彤彤熟透了的番茄，不觉得看起来就十分的美味吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/Vy0tU7dbU0pgwnjYVtGVj0sYrEMYQ2Rc.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，这也是我身为供餐部一员的成果。用心努力去栽培果然是值得的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/G2XNma0WYdFAgTOXaOSmxxNysLrlb440.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，那边的番茄也长得很不错……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/KQYtN6RN9ld5k6T2HgiEJFjytsYd7Csu.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"唔，嗯……就，就在，那边……话说……距离是不是有点近……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/NEQux8gXZjPvVq45XGBR0jBgmtsHmZSo.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"距离这么近的话，唔，我……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/rgK4MkkIoiN29yM7nYUxUpbfjH9dbdW3.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"（啊，是老师的味道……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/vHGlYE8vDtJtmeyO9ySpMlZ1RagcgHl2.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"（总，总觉得心脏突然跳得好快呀……？！）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/in0CyL0COGOazK5d7IDc60iJYGLnNXQ0.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"没，没事的！对！不用担心我……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/bnXD8SMLL1z36E2sm1YvMaxuV6Qt6ORU.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"只是这该怎么说呢？就是……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/eBVpQm3zdPclYG7InFv8omDiwAMKNCvs.ogg"},{"description":"juri_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么，总觉得脸热得发烫，这……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/CUWSrmJOmAsNqOmxlECUAZoGDLoEYlpx.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"juri_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/original/juri_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%89%9B%E7%89%A7%20%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89/original/juri_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"juri_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//sta